 "ぢゅう": "عَبْر (From one side or end of (something) to the other.) / خِلَالَ, عَبْرَ (From one side or end of (something) to the other.) / فِي (Amidst or surrounded by (while moving).) / بِوَاسِطَة (By means of.)  [(all) through (e.g. the night)]\nمثال: 彼は夏中ずっと長野にいた。\n→ He stayed in Nagano throughout the summer. / دَاخِل (In the inner part, spatially; physically inside.) / في غضون (In the scope or range of.) / فِي خِلَال (Before the specified duration ends.)  [within (e.g. the week)]\nas 〜に\nمثال: 最終提案は来週中に発表されます。\n→ The final proposal will be announced sometime next week. / جَمِيع أَنْحَاء, كُلّ (Everywhere; covering completely.)  [all over]\nمثال: その知らせは村中に不安をまき起こした。\n→ The news caused alarm throughout the village. / كُلّ, جَمِيع (Every individual or anything of the given class, with no exceptions (the noun or) / كُلّ, جَمِيع (Wholly; entirely; completely; totally.) / جَمِيع (Everything that one is capable of.)  [all (of a group)]\nمثال: その事件は学校中にショックを与えた。\n→ The incident gave a shock to the whole school.",
