 "っきゃ": "اِسْتَثْنَى (To exclude; to specify as being an exception.) / إِلَّا, بِاسْتِثْنَاء (Used to introduce an exception or qualification to something previously stated.) / إِلَّا (Used to introduce a clause, phrase, verb infinitive, adverb or other non-noun co)  [except]\nwith neg. verb",
 "っきり": "وَحِيد (1. alone in a category) / فَقَط (Without others or anything further; exclusively.) / فَقَط (No more than; just.) / فَقَط (Introduces a clause with negative polarity, often one which upsets the listener')  [only] / مُنْذُ (from (time)) / مُنْذُ (From the time that.) / لِأَنَّ (Because.)  [(ever) since]\nusu. in a negative sentence / باستمرار (Without pause.)  [continuously]",
 "っけ": "لافِتَة (A clearly visible object, generally flat, bearing a short message in words or pi) / وَقَّعَ (To make a mark)  [sign]",
