 "ってのは": "عَنَى, عَنَى (To convey (a meaning).) / لَئِيم, خَسِيس (Intending to cause harm, successfully or otherwise; bearing ill will towards ano) / مُتَوَسِّط (the statistical value)  [means]",
 "ってば": "على فِكْرَةٍ (Speaking of which; relatedly, used to introduce a related topic.)  [speaking of]\nindicates emotional closeness or annoyance with someone\nمثال: あっ、赤くなった。陸くんてば可愛いっ！！ふふふっ。\n→ Ah-you've gone all red. Riku - that's so cute!! Ha-haha. / قَد, مِنْ قَبْلُ (Prior to some specified time, either past, present, or future; by this time; pre) / لقد (So soon.)  [(I told you) already]\nindicates annoyance (in sentence-final position)\nمثال: しーっ、聞こえちゃうってば。\n→ Shhh, she'll hear you!",
