 "っ放し": "تَرَكَ (To have a consequence or remnant.) / تَرَكَ, غَادَرَ (To depart; to separate from.) / إِجَازَة, عُطْلَة (Permission to be absent; time away from one's work.)  [leaving (on, open, unfinished, etc.)]\nafter the -masu stem of a verb; indicates that something is left in an improper state\nمثال: 一日中立ちっぱなしだったのでくたくただ。\n→ I'm worn out, because I've been standing all day. / باستمرار (Without pause.)  [(doing) continuously]\nafter the -masu stem of a verb",
