 "つかあさい": "أَرْضَى, أَعْجَبَ (To make happy or satisfy; to give pleasure to.) / مِن فَضْلِك (interjection to make a polite request) / رَجَاءً (interjection to make a polite request) / لَو سَمَحْت (interjection to make a polite request) / لُطْفًا (interjection to make a polite request) / أَرْجُوك (interjection to make a polite request)  [please (do for me)]\nChūgoku dialect",
