 "つかい": "مُهِمَّة, مَأْمُورِيَّة (A set of tasks that fulfills a purpose or duty; an assignment set by an employer)  [mission]\nمثال: 使いの途中道草をくうな。\n→ Don't delay on this errand. / رَسُول, قَاصِد (One who brings messages.)  [messenger] / [familiar spirit] / اِسْتِعْمَال, اِسْتِخْدَام (The act of using.) / اِسْتَعْمَلَ, اِسْتَخْدَمَ (To utilize or employ.)  [use]\noft. read づかい when used as a suffix\nمثال: ひとことで言えば、彼はおべっか使いだ。\n→ In a word, he is a flatterer.",
