 "つかいもの": "[useful thing ; usable article]\nusu. with neg. sentence\nمثال: この古いスーツはもうほとんど使いものにならない。新しいのを買わなきゃならないだろう。\n→ This old suit has just about had it; I shall have to get a new one. / حَالِيّ, حَاضِر (Relating to now, for the time being; current.) / مَوْجُود, حَاضِر (Located in the immediate vicinity.) / الزَّمَان, الْحَال (The current moment or period of time.) / قَدَّمَ, طَرَحَ (To bring (someone) into the presence of (a person); to introduce formally.)  [present]",
 "つかいものにならない": "عَدِيمُ الْفَائِدَةِ (Without use or the possibility to be used.)  [useless]\nمثال: 何でもかんでもメモをしますがあとで使い物になりません。\n→ I note down absolutely everything, but they're no good to me afterwards.",
 "つかいもん": "[useful thing ; usable article]\nusu. with neg. sentence\nمثال: この古いスーツはもうほとんど使いものにならない。新しいのを買わなきゃならないだろう。\n→ This old suit has just about had it; I shall have to get a new one. / حَالِيّ, حَاضِر (Relating to now, for the time being; current.) / مَوْجُود, حَاضِر (Located in the immediate vicinity.) / الزَّمَان, الْحَال (The current moment or period of time.) / قَدَّمَ, طَرَحَ (To bring (someone) into the presence of (a person); to introduce formally.)  [present]",
