 "つかえる": "عَبَدَ (To provide a service (or, by extension, a product, especially food or drink).) / خَدَمَ (To provide a service (or, by extension, a product, especially food or drink).) / قَدَّمَ (To provide a service (or, by extension, a product, especially food or drink).) / أَرْسَلَ (To lead off with the first delivery over the net in tennis, volleyball, ping pon) / خَدَمَ (To be in military service.) / إِرْسَال (An act of putting the ball or shuttlecock in play in various games.)  [to serve]\nمثال: コックは家族に長年仕えた。\n→ The cook served the family for many years.",
