 "つかまつる": "فَعَلَ, عَمِلَ (To perform; to execute.) / دُو, دُو (A syllable used in solfège to represent the first and eighth tonic of a major sc)  [to do] / عَبَدَ (To provide a service (or, by extension, a product, especially food or drink).) / خَدَمَ (To provide a service (or, by extension, a product, especially food or drink).) / قَدَّمَ (To provide a service (or, by extension, a product, especially food or drink).) / أَرْسَلَ (To lead off with the first delivery over the net in tennis, volleyball, ping pon) / خَدَمَ (To be in military service.) / إِرْسَال (An act of putting the ball or shuttlecock in play in various games.)  [to serve]",
 "つかまる": "[to be caught ; to be arrested]\nusu. 捕まる / قَبْضَة (Grip.)  [to grasp]\nusu. 掴まる\nمثال: つり革につかまりなさい。電車がすぐ動き出すだろうから。\n→ Hold on to the strap. The train will start to move soon. / وَجَدَ, لَقِيَ (To locate.) / لَقِيَّة (Anything that is found (usually valuable), as objects on an archeological site o)  [to find (e.g. proof)] / [to be detained by]",
