 "つかみ所": "نُقْطَة (A small dot or mark.) / نُقْطَة (A small discrete division or individual feature of something.) / مَوْقِع (A small discrete division or individual feature of something.) / أَشَارَ (To extend the index finger in the direction of something in order to show where )  [point (of a question, story, etc.)] / مَسَكَ, مسك (To grasp or grip.)  [hold]",
