 "つったつ": "وَقَفَ, وقف (To position or be positioned physically:)  [to stand (e.g. of a tree)] / [to stand up abruptly ; to jump to one's feet] / وَقَفَ, وقف (To position or be positioned physically:)  [to stand (doing nothing)]",
