 "てまちん": "دَفْع (The act of paying.)  [payment (for labour)]",
 "てまね": "لَفْتَة, إِشَارَة (A motion of the limbs or body, especially one made to emphasize speech.)  [gesture]",
 "てまねき": "أَشَارَ, أَوْمَأَ (To wave or nod to somebody with the intention to make the person come closer.)  [beckoning]\nمثال: 彼女は僕に中へはいるよう手招きした。\n→ She beckoned me to come in.",
 "てまねく": "أَشَارَ, أَوْمَأَ (To wave or nod to somebody with the intention to make the person come closer.)  [to beckon]",
 "てまひま": "مُشْكِلَة, مَتاعِب (A distressing or dangerous situation.)  [trouble]\nمثال: この機会のおかげで私たちは大いに手間暇が省けた。\n→ Thanks to the opportunity, we were able to avoid substantial effort.",
