 "てまん": "إِصْبَع ((anatomy) extremity of the hand) / بَنَان ((anatomy) extremity of the hand) / صَبَّعَ (To use the fingers to penetrate or sexually stimulate one's own or another perso)  [fingering]",
 "てみじか": "قَصِير, قصير (Having a small distance from one end or edge to another, either horizontally or ) / قَصِير (Having little duration.)  [short]\nمثال: 講演者は自分の論題がわかっていなかったし、話もうまくなかった、手短に言うと、彼にはがっかりさせられた。\n→ The speaker didn't know his subject, nor did he speak well; in short, he was disappointing.",
 "てみじかい": "قَصِير, قصير (Having a small distance from one end or edge to another, either horizontally or ) / قَصِير (Having little duration.)  [short]",
 "てみじかにいえば": "بِاِخْتِصَار (In a brief manner, summarily.)  [briefly]",
 "てみやげ": "حَالِيّ, حَاضِر (Relating to now, for the time being; current.) / مَوْجُود, حَاضِر (Located in the immediate vicinity.) / الزَّمَان, الْحَال (The current moment or period of time.) / قَدَّمَ, طَرَحَ (To bring (someone) into the presence of (a person); to introduce formally.)  [present (brought by a visitor)]",
