 "てめえ": "مَن, اَلْمَرْء (Anyone, one; an unspecified individual or group of individuals (as subject or ob) / ـكُم, ـكُنَّ (A dummy pronoun used in certain constructions, usually with verbs of receiving ()  [you]\nمثال: てめぇら、死にやがれ！\n→ Fuck you all to hell! / أَي, إِي (The name of the Latin script letter I/i.)  [I]",
 "ても": "بِالرَغْم مِن (Although; though; despite or in spite of the fact that.)  [even though]\nalso でも, っても / عَجَبًا (An indication of excitement, surprise, astonishment, or pleasure.) / سُبْحَانَ الله (An expression of amazement, awe, or admiration.)  [wow]",
 "てもと": "[at hand ; on hand]\nمثال: 私はいつも辞典を３冊手元に置いています。\n→ I always keep three dictionaries at hand. / مَهَارَة (A capacity to do something well; a technique, an ability, usually acquired or le)  [skill] / مَصْرُوف جَيْب, مَصْرُوف (A small sum of money given to a child, by a parent or guardian; an allowance)  [pocket money] / مَقْبِض (A handle or other place to grip)  [grip]",
