 "てゆーか": "[or rather (say) ; or better (say)] / بِالْمُنَاسَبَةِ, عَلَى فِكْرَةٍ (Incidentally; used in referencing a parenthetical statement not timely, central,)  [by the way]",
 "てら": "مَعْبَد (place of worship — see also place of worship) / هَيْكَل (place of worship — see also place of worship) / صَدْغ (The slightly flatter region, on either side of the head of a vertebrate, includi) / ذِرَاع (Either of the sidepieces on a set of spectacles, extending backwards from the hi)  [temple (Buddhist)]\nمثال: これが彼の泊っているお寺です。\n→ This is the temple where he stays.",
