 "てらう": "اِسْتِعْرَاض, مَوْكِب (An organized display of a group of people, particularly)  [to parade]",
 "てらしあわせる": "تَفَقُّد (An inspection or examination.) / كِشّ مَلِك (A situation in which the king is directly threatened by an opposing piece.) / فَاتُورَة, حِسَاب (A bill, particularly in a restaurant.) / اِسْتَأْنَى, دَقَّقَ (To inspect; to examine.) / كَشَّ (To make a move which puts an adversary's king in check; to put in check.)  [to check]\nمثال: 君らは自らの責任において、自らの良心に照らし合わせ、決定を下さなくてはならない。\n→ You must make decisions about your responsibility in the light of your conscience.",
 "てらす": "[to shine on ; to illuminate] / قَارَنَ (To assess the similarities and differences between two or more things [“to compa) / شَبَّهَ (To declare two things to be similar in some respect [“to compare X to Y”].)  [to compare (with)]\nمثال: 君の答えを彼のと照らし合わせなさい。\n→ Check your answer with his.",
