 "とおす": "[to let pass ; to allow through]\nمثال: 彼はトラックを通すために車を横に寄せた。\n→ He pulled aside to let a truck pass. / [to transmit (e.g. light, sound, etc.) ; to conduct (electricity)]\nمثال: 銅はよく電気を通す。\n→ Copper conducts electricity well. / خَيْط, خيط (A cord formed by spinning or twisting together textile fibers or filaments into ) / خَيْط (A unit of execution, lighter in weight than a process, usually sharing memory an) / مَوْضُوع (A series of posts or messages, consisting of an initial post and responses to it)  [to thread (e.g. a needle)]\nمثال: 針に糸を通すことができないので縫い物は好きではありません。\n→ I don't like sewing because I can't thread the needle. / رَبَطَ (to join two or more pieces)  [to connect (e.g. two places)]\nمثال: 山を通してトンネルを通した。\n→ They drove a tunnel through the hill.",
