 "とがた": "[square bearing block (at the top of a pillar)]",
 "とがった": "نُقْطَة (A small dot or mark.) / نُقْطَة (A small discrete division or individual feature of something.) / مَوْقِع (A small discrete division or individual feature of something.) / أَشَارَ (To extend the index finger in the direction of something in order to show where )  [pointed]\nمثال: きつつきは、長く尖ったくちばしで、木の幹をつついて、中にいる虫を食べます。\n→ Woodpeckers peck tree trunks with their long pointed beaks and eat insects found there. / حَادّ (Terminating in a point or edge, especially one that can cut or pierce easily; no)  [sharp (voice, words, etc.)] / مُسْتَفِز (Serving or tending to elicit a strong, often negative sentiment in another perso)  [provocative] / نَصْل (The sharp edge of the blade of a knife or other cutting tool.)  [cutting edge]",
 "とがにん": "جَانٍ (A person who commits an offense against the law, a lawbreaker.)  [offender]",
 "とがめ": "لَوْم, مَلَامَة (Censure.) / لَامَ (To assert or consider that someone is the cause of something negative; to place )  [blame]\nمثال: もしあなたが試験でカンニングをやってもそれで何の咎めも受けずに済むと思っているなら、とんでもない話だ。\n→ If you think you can get away with cheating on the exam, you've got another thing coming.",
 "とがめだて": "شَبُّوط (any of various freshwater fish of the family Cyprinidae)  [carping]\nمثال: 僕のやることにとがめだてしないでくれ。\n→ Don't find fault with me.",
 "とがめる": "لَوْم, مَلَامَة (Censure.) / لَامَ (To assert or consider that someone is the cause of something negative; to place )  [to blame]\nمثال: 先生は彼女が間違ったことを咎めた。\n→ The teacher blamed her for the mistake. / سُؤَال, سؤال (A worded or expressed sentence, phrase, or only a word on its own, which asks fo) / مَسْأَلَة (A subject or topic for consideration or investigation.) / استفهم (To ask questions of; to interrogate; to ask for information.)  [to question (a suspect)]\nمثال: 守衛にとがめられた。\n→ I was challenged by a gatekeeper. / [to aggravate (an injury) ; to be aggravated] / زُبّ, زُبْر (The penis.)  [to prick (one's conscience)]",
