 "とがらせる": "شَحَذَ (To make sharp.)  [to sharpen (e.g. pencil)] / [to get nervous ; to set one's nerves on edge] / رَفَعَ (to cause to rise)  [to raise (e.g. one's voice)]",
 "とがり": "نُقْطَة (A small dot or mark.) / نُقْطَة (A small discrete division or individual feature of something.) / مَوْقِع (A small discrete division or individual feature of something.) / أَشَارَ (To extend the index finger in the direction of something in order to show where )  [point] / [becoming pointed ; becoming sharp]",
