 "とがりょう": "غَرَامَة (A fee levied as punishment for breaking the law.) / غَرَّمَ (To issue a fine as punishment to (someone).)  [fine (for a minor offence)]\nمثال: 彼は酔払い運転のかどで５ポンドの科料に処せられた。\n→ He was fined five pounds for drunken driving.",
 "とき": "وَقْت (A duration of time.) / مَرَّة, مرة (An instant of time.) / وَقْت (An instant of time.) / حِين, وَقْت (A ratio of comparison (see also usage notes and prepositional sense at 'times').)  [time]\n刻 signifies a time of day; 秋 signifies an important time\nمثال: １２才の時彼は声変わりした。\n→ His voice broke when he was twelve. / فُرْصَة, مُنَاسَبَة (A favorable opportunity; a convenient or timely chance.) / مُنَاسَبَة (A particular happening; an instance or time when something occurred.)  [occasion]\nمثال: 車を運転する時はいくら注意してもしすぎることはない。\n→ You cannot be too careful when you drive a car. / فُرْصَة (An opportunity or possibility.)  [chance] / فِي (Multiplied by (see also 'ratio of comparison' sense at 'time').)  [the times]",
