 "ときおよぶ": "ذِكْر (A speaking or noticing of anything, usually in a brief or cursory manner.) / ذَكَرَ (To make mention of; to speak of; to refer to; to name; to specify)  [to mention]\nمثال: 彼は生命の起源にまで説き及んだ。\n→ He even referred to the origin of life.",
 "ときおり": "أَحْيَانًا, سَاعَات (On some occasions, over some periods, or in certain circumstances, but not alway)  [sometimes]\nمثال: 私は時おり学校で彼に会う。\n→ I meet him at school now and then.",
 "ときがかいけつする": "الزَّمَن يُعَالِجُ كُل الأَجْرَاح (Negative feelings eventually fade away.)  [time heals all wounds]",
 "とききかせる": "شَرَحَ (to make intelligible) / فَسَّرَ (to make intelligible) / أَبَانَ (to make intelligible)  [to explain]",
