 "ときの気": "مَرَض مُعْدٍ (An illness caused by a specific infectious agent (bacterium, virus, fungus, prot)  [infectious disease]",
 "ときはかねなり": "اَلْوَقْتُ مِنْ ذَهَبٍ (Money is wasted (in lost wages, missed opportunities, etc.) when a person's time)  [time is money]\nمثال: 時は金なりとは至言である。\n→ It is truly said that time is money.",
