 "とこ": "مَيْدَان (An area; somewhere within an area.) / مَكَان (An area; somewhere within an area.) / مَقْعَد (An area; somewhere within an area.) / مَكَان, مكان (A location or position in space.) / وَضَعَ, حط (To put (someone or something) in a specific location.)  [place]\nalso pronounced どころ when a suffix\nمثال: さあ、今汲みなさい。そして宴会の世話役の所に持っていきなさい。\n→ Now draw some out and take it to the master of the banquet. / خُطْبَة, نِدَاء (Direction.) / عُنْوَان, عِنْوَان (Direction.) / عَنْوَنَ (To direct in writing, as a letter; to superscribe, or to direct and transmit.)  [address] / مِنْطَقَة (An area or region marked by some distinguishing feature.)  [district] / [one's house]\nمثال: 「そのうちに、あなたのところにお邪魔してもいいですか」「どうぞ、どうぞ」\n→ \"Do you mind if I call on you sometime?\" \"No, not at all.\"",
