 "とつにゅう": "عَاصِفَة (disturbed state of the atmosphere causing destructive or unp) / طُوفَان (disturbed state of the atmosphere causing destructive or unp) / عَاصْفة (disturbed state of the atmosphere causing destructive or unp)  [storming]\nمثال: 警察がバーに突入した。\n→ The police charged into the bar. / [plunging into (war, etc.) ; embarking on (a new venture)]",
