 "とて": "مُسَطَّح, مُنبَسِط (Flat and level.) / أَمْلَس, سَوِيّ (Without great variation.) / زَوْجِيّ (Of an integer, divisible by two.) / حَتَّى (In reality (used to imply an extreme example in the case mentioned).)  [even]\nمثال: 私たちが環境面の問題を耳にしないで過ぎる日は１日とてない。\n→ Not a day goes by without our hearing of an environmental problem. / [even if ... ; even though ...] / [because ... ; as ...]\noft. as こととて / [with the purpose of ... ; in order to ...]",
