 "とてつもない": "مُسْرِف (Profuse in expenditure; prodigal; wasteful.)  [extravagant]\nمثال: その地震はとてつもなく大きな津波を引き起こした。\n→ The earthquake created a tremendous sea wave. / ضَخْم, هَائِل (Extremely large; greatly exceeding the common size, extent, etc.)  [enormous]",
 "とても": "جِدًّا (To a great extent or degree.)  [very]\nとっても is more emphatic\nمثال: 「これはとてもおもしろそうだね」とひろしが言います。\n→ \"This looks pretty interesting,\" Hiroshi says. / أبداً (Indicating degree, quantity or frequency greater than zero: to the slightest deg)  [(not) at all]\nbefore a negative form\nمثال: この雨の中を外出することはとてもできないことです。\n→ Going out in this rain is out of the question.",
