 "とてもとても": "أبداً (Indicating degree, quantity or frequency greater than zero: to the slightest deg)  [(not) at all]\nemphatic; with neg. sentence",
 "とでもない": "لَا يَخْطُرُ عَلَى الْبَالِ (That cannot be believed.) / لَا يَخْطُرُ عَلَى الْبَالِ (Inconceivable or unimaginable; extremely improbable in a way that goes against c)  [unthinkable]",
 "とと": "أَب, وَالِد (A male parent, especially of a human; a male who parents a child (which he has s) / بَابَا (A term of respectful address for a priest.)  [father]",
