 "ととのえ": "تَحْضِير, إِعْدَاد (The act of preparing or getting ready.)  [preparation]",
 "ととのえる": "رَتَّبَ (To set up; to organize; to put into an orderly sequence or arrangement.)  [to arrange]\nesp. 整える\nمثال: 私の姉は毎週、髪を整えてもらう。\n→ My sister has her hair done each week. / جَهَّزَ, حَضَّرَ (To make ready for a specific future purpose; to set up; to assemble or equip; to) / اِسْتَعَدَّ, تَأَهَّبَ (To make oneself ready; to get ready, make preparation.)  [to prepare]\nesp. 調える\nمثال: 私たちはスキーの装備を整えた。\n→ We fitted ourselves out for skiing. / ضَبَطَ (To adjust (a mechanism) for accurate and proper functioning.)  [to regulate (e.g. rhythm, tune, one's breathing)] / رَتَّبَ (To set up; to organize; to put into an orderly sequence or arrangement.)  [to arrange (e.g. marriage)]\nesp. 調える",
