 "とどく": "بَلَغَ (To extend, stretch, or thrust out (for example a limb or object held in the hand)  [to reach]\nمثال: 彼女の声は騒音でよく届かなかった。\n→ Her voice did not carry well over the noise. / وَصَلَ (To reach; to get to a certain place.)  [to arrive]\nمثال: 私あての手紙は届いていますか？\n→ Have any letters arrived for me? / [to be attentive ; to be scrupulous]\nas 目が届く, 神経が届く, etc.\nمثال: ここからでも声は届くよ。\n→ You can make yourself heard even from here. / [to be realized (of a desire) ; to be fulfilled]",
 "とどけ": "وَصَفَ, أَبْلَغَ (To relate details of (an event or incident); to recount, describe (something).) / أَبْلَغَ (To notify someone of (particular intelligence, suspicions, illegality, misconduc) / تَقْرِير, بَلَاغ (A piece of information describing, or an account of certain events given or pres)  [report]\nمثال: 盗難の届をだしたいのですけど。\n→ I would like to report a theft.",
 "とどけいで": "وَصَفَ, أَبْلَغَ (To relate details of (an event or incident); to recount, describe (something).) / أَبْلَغَ (To notify someone of (particular intelligence, suspicions, illegality, misconduc) / تَقْرِير, بَلَاغ (A piece of information describing, or an account of certain events given or pres)  [report]",
