 "とどけずみ": "وَصَفَ, أَبْلَغَ (To relate details of (an event or incident); to recount, describe (something).) / أَبْلَغَ (To notify someone of (particular intelligence, suspicions, illegality, misconduc) / تَقْرِير, بَلَاغ (A piece of information describing, or an account of certain events given or pres)  [reported]",
