 "とどける": "نَقَلَ (To bring or transport something to its destination.)  [to deliver]\nمثال: 家に届けていただけますか。\n→ Can you deliver it to my house? / وَصَفَ, أَبْلَغَ (To relate details of (an event or incident); to recount, describe (something).) / أَبْلَغَ (To notify someone of (particular intelligence, suspicions, illegality, misconduc) / تَقْرِير, بَلَاغ (A piece of information describing, or an account of certain events given or pres)  [to report]\nمثال: 私は車が盗まれたことを警察に届けた。\n→ I reported the theft of my car to the police.",
 "とどこおり": "رُكُود (The state of being stagnant; (countable) an instance of this.) / ركود اقتصادي (The state of being stagnant; (countable) an instance of this.)  [stagnation]\nمثال: 滞りのない、優雅な仕草でグラスに水を注ぎ込んだ。\n→ She smoothly and elegantly poured the water into the glass.",
