 "とどめる": "وَقَفَ, تَوَقَّفَ (To cease moving.) / أَوْقَفَ, وَقَفَ (To cause (something) to cease moving or progressing.) / تَوَقَّفَ, وَقَّف (To cease; to no longer continue.) / أَوْقَفَ, وَقَفَ (To cause (something) to come to an end.) / مَوْقِف (A (usually marked) place where buses, trams or trains halt to let passengers get) / وَقْفَة (An action of stopping; interruption of travel.)  [to stop] / [to have (someone) stay ; to put up (a guest)] / دَبُّوس (A needle without an eye (usually) made of drawn-out steel wire with one end shar)  [to pin] / حَدّ (A restriction; a bound beyond which one may not go or proceed.) / نِهَايَة (A value to which a sequence converges. Equivalently, the common value of the upp) / حَدَّ, حَدَّدَ (To restrict; to circumscribe; not to allow to go beyond a certain bound, to set )  [to limit]\nمثال: 我々はあらゆる学校を運営させ続け、あらゆる教師を職にとどめておくべきです。\n→ We should keep every school open and every teacher in his job.",
 "とどろ": "أَنَّ (To make a loud, deep cry, especially from pain, anger, or other strong emotion.) / قَهْقَهَ (To laugh in a particularly loud manner.) / زَئِير (The cry of the lion.)  [roaring]",
 "とどろかす": "فَعَلَ, صَنَعَ (To create.) / جَعَلَ (To cause to be.) / جَعَلَ (To force to do.) / جَعَلَ (To indicate or suggest to be.)  [to make (a thundering sound)] / [to make (one's name, etc.) widely known] / خَفَقَ (To pound or beat rapidly or violently.) / خَفَقَ, نَبَضَ (To pulse (often painfully) in time with the circulation of blood.) / خَفَقَان (A beating, vibration or palpitation.)  [to throb]\nas 胸を〜",
 "とどろき": "أَنَّ (To make a loud, deep cry, especially from pain, anger, or other strong emotion.) / قَهْقَهَ (To laugh in a particularly loud manner.) / زَئِير (The cry of the lion.)  [roar] / ضَرْب (The action by which someone or something is beaten.)  [beating]",
 "とどろきわたる": "أَنَّ (To make a loud, deep cry, especially from pain, anger, or other strong emotion.) / قَهْقَهَ (To laugh in a particularly loud manner.) / زَئِير (The cry of the lion.)  [to roar]",
 "とどろく": "أَنَّ (To make a loud, deep cry, especially from pain, anger, or other strong emotion.) / قَهْقَهَ (To laugh in a particularly loud manner.) / زَئِير (The cry of the lion.)  [to roar]\nمثال: 雷鳴がとどろいた。\n→ The thunder roared. / [to become well known ; to become famous] / بَاوْنْد (unit of mass (16 ounces avoirdupois)) / رَطْل (unit of mass (16 ounces avoirdupois)) / جُنَيْه (unit of currency) / لِيرَة f or لَيْرَة (unit of currency)  [to pound (of one's heart)]",
 "となえ": "اِسْم (The personal name chosen for a child, usually by their parents.)  [given name]",
 "となえる": "تَلَا (To repeat aloud (some passage, poem or other text previously memorized, or in fr)  [to recite] / بَكَى, عَيَّط (To shed tears; to weep, especially in anger or sadness.) / صَاحَ (To shout, scream, yell.) / بكاء (A shedding of tears; the act of crying.)  [to cry]\nمثال: 彼は減税を唱えた。\n→ He advocated reduction of taxes. / محامي, محامية (Anyone who argues the case of another; an intercessor.) / ناطق بلسان, لسان حال (A person who speaks in support of something, or someone; proponent) / أوصى ب (To encourage support for something.) / حامى, رافع (To engage in advocacy.)  [to advocate]",
 "となかい": "رَنَة (Any Arctic and subarctic-dwelling deer of the species Rangifer tarandus, with a )  [reindeer (Rangifer tarandus)]",
 "となり": "قَادِم (Nearest in place or position, having nothing similar intervening; adjoining.) / تَالٍ (Nearest in order, succession, or rank; immediately following (or sometimes prece) / بِجَانِب (On the side of; nearest or adjacent to; next to.)  [next (to)]\nمثال: ジョーダンさんは彼の隣に座った。\n→ Mr Jordan sat down beside him. / [house next door ; neighbouring house]",
