 "とろかす": "ذَابَ, انْصَهَرَ (To change (or to be changed) from a solid state to a liquid state, usually by a )  [to melt (steel, etc.)] / ذَابَ, انْصَهَرَ (To change (or to be changed) from a solid state to a liquid state, usually by a )  [to melt (one's heart)]",
