 "とんだ": "مُفَاجِئ (Not expected, anticipated or foreseen.)  [unexpected]\nمثال: 証人喚問はとんだ騒ぎになってしまいました。\n→ The confirmation hearings turned into a free-for-all. / فَظِيع (Dreadful; causing terror, alarm and fear; awesome) / مُرْعِب (Formidable, powerful.) / مُرْعِب (Intense; extreme in degree or extent.) / فَظِيع, أَرْبَد (Very unpleasant; disagreeable.) / فَظِيع, أَرْبَد (Very bad; lousy.)  [terrible] / جِدًّا (To a great extent or degree.)  [very]",
