 "とんとん": "[with a tap ; with a knock]\nمثال: 彼女は指でテーブルをとんとんたたいた。\n→ She drummed her fingers on the table. / [smoothly (proceed) ; without a hitch] / مُسَطَّح, مُنبَسِط (Flat and level.) / أَمْلَس, سَوِيّ (Without great variation.) / زَوْجِيّ (Of an integer, divisible by two.) / حَتَّى (In reality (used to imply an extreme example in the case mentioned).)  [even]",
 "とんとんびょうし": "سَهْل (Requiring little skill or effort.)  [easy]\nmost frequently used adverbially as 〜に\nمثال: この国の経済は近年とんとん拍子に成長しています。\n→ This nation's economy is growing by leaps and bounds in recent years.",
