 "と言う": "دَعَا, نَادَى (To reach out with one's voice.) / اِتَّصَلَ بِـ (To reach out with one's voice.) / دَعَا, سَمَّى (To name, identify, or describe.) / اِتِّصَال, مُكَالَمَة (A telephone conversation; a phone call.) / زِيَارَة (A short visit, usually for social purposes.)  [called]\nمثال: ＆という記号は、ａｎｄを指す。\n→ The sign '&' stands for 'and'. / [as many as ; as much as]\nafter a quantity / [all ... ; every single ...]\nas ＡというＡ",
 "と言うのに": "بِالرَغْم مِن (Although; though; despite or in spite of the fact that.)  [even though]\nمثال: 皆留守だというのに、不思議なことに家中の電灯がついていた。\n→ Strange to say, all the lights in the house were on, though no one was at home.",
 "と言うのも": "لِأَنَّ (By or for the cause that; on this account that; for the reason that.) / هكذا, بلا سبب (Used alone to refuse to provide a full answer to a question begun with \"why\", us)  [because]\nمثال: 彼女はここ２ヶ月間ダイエットをしている。というのも、冬の間体重がかなり増えすぎたからだ。\n→ She has been on a diet for the past two months because she put on too much weight during the winter.",
 "と言うより": "بَدَلًا مِن (Used to indicate that the following alternative is less preferred.) / أَكْثَر مِن, عَنّ (Instead of; in preference to.)  [rather than]",
 "と言う訳": "[this is why ; that is the reason why]\nfollowed by a copula\nمثال: 新婚なのに子供？そう・・・息子は父親の連れ子。彼はバツイチというわけだ。\n→ Newlyweds but with a child? Yes, that's right - the son is from the father's former marriage. He's been divorced once. / فَـ, لِذَا (As a result; for that reason; therefore; because of this; due to this.) / إِذًا, فَ (Used after a pause for thought to introduce a new topic, question or story, or a)  [so]\noft. as ～で\nمثال: というわけで、人材を啓発するためのセンターが日本に作られるべきであろう。\n→ Therefore, a center for the development of human resources should be built in Japan.",
 "と言えども": "بِالرَغْم مِن (Although; though; despite or in spite of the fact that.)  [even though]\nمثال: 親友といえども、その友情を維持する努力が必要である。\n→ Even good friends should make an effort to keep up their friendship.",
 "と言って": "بِأَيَّةِ طَرِيقَة, عَلَى كُلِّ حَال (In any way that one likes or chooses; in a haphazard or spontaneous way.)  [however]",
 "と言っていいほど": "عَمَلِيًّا (In practice; in effect or in actuality, though possibly not officially, technica)  [practically]",
