 "ど": "دَرَجَة (A unit of measurement of angle equal to ¹⁄₃₆₀ of a circle's circumference.)  [degree (angle, temperature, scale, etc.)]\nمثال: 水は摂氏０度で凍る。\n→ Water freezes at 0 degrees Centigrade. / [counter for occurrences]\nمثال: 彼女は２度のフライングで失格した。\n→ She was disqualified from the race for two false starts. / قُوَّة (The quality or degree of being strong.)  [strength (of glasses)] / [alcohol content (percentage) ; alcohol by volume]",
