 "どいつもこいつも": "اَلْجَمِيع, كُلّ شَخْص (Every individual in a set; all people.)  [everybody]\nusu. negative nuance\nمثال: 正直どいつもこいつもパッとしない。\n→ Frankly, no one really stands out.",
 "どう": "حَرَكَة (A change whereby something goes from one place to another; a state of progressio)  [motion]\nمثال: 私たちはスペリオル湖まで景色のよい自動車動をドライブした。\n→ We went for a scenic drive as far as Lake Superior.",
