 "どうあっても": "مَهْمَا (Regardless of, in spite of, whatever.)  [no matter what]\nمثال: どうあってもあなたをお助けできません。\n→ I cannot possibly help you.",
 "どうい": "اِتِّفَاق, تَوَافُق (An understanding between entities to follow a specific course of conduct.) / إِقْرَار (A state whereby several parties share a view or opinion; the state of not contra) / اِتِّفَاق, اِتِّفَاقِيَّة (A legally binding contract enforceable in a court of law.)  [agreement]\nمثال: ボブはその計画に同意しなかった。\n→ Bob did not agree to the plan. / [same opinion ; same view] / [same meaning]",
