 "どういう風に": "كَيْف, ازاي (In what manner) / كَيْفَ, ازاي (In what manner:) / كَيْفَ, ازاي (In what state or condition.) / كَمْ, يَا لَ (Used as a modifier to indicate surprise, delight, or other strong feelings in an)  [how]\nمثال: どういう風にしてそこへ行くか説明して下さい。\n→ Please explain how to get there.",
 "どういげんそ": "نَظِير (Any of two or more forms of an element where the atoms have the same number of p)  [isotope]",
 "どういご": "مُرَادِف (A term (word or phrase) which is synonymous with others.)  [synonym]\nمثال: 「車」は「自動車」の同意語です。\n→ \"Car\" is a synonym of \"automobile\".",
