 "どきんどきん": "[thump-thump ; bang-bang]\nمثال: 彼は心臓がどきどき打っているのを感じた。\n→ He felt his heart beating fast. / خَفَقَ (To pound or beat rapidly or violently.) / خَفَقَ, نَبَضَ (To pulse (often painfully) in time with the circulation of blood.) / خَفَقَان (A beating, vibration or palpitation.)  [to throb]",
 "どぎつい": "عَالٍ, اَلْعَالِي (Noisy.)  [loud]\nمثال: そのどぎつい光は目に悪い。\n→ The glaring light is hurtful to the eyes.",
 "どぎまぎ": "مُسْتَاء, مُمْتَعِض (Angry, distressed, or unhappy) / إخْلَال (Disturbance or disruption.) / أَسْخَطَ (To make (a person) angry, distressed, or unhappy.) / أَخَلَّ (To disturb, disrupt or adversely alter (something).)  [upset]\nمثال: その内気な少年は、彼女の前ですっかりどぎまぎしていた。\n→ The shy boy was utterly embarrassed in her presence.",
 "どぎも": "أَحْشَاء (The entrails or contents of the abdomen.)  [guts]",
 "どぎもをぬく": "أَذْهَلَ (To surprise greatly.)  [to astonish]",
 "どく": "سُمّ, سَمّ (A substance that is harmful or lethal to a living organism when ingested.) / سَمَّمَ, سَمَّ (To use poison to kill or paralyse (somebody).)  [poison]\nمثال: この魚は毒がない。\n→ This fish is free from poison. / ضَرَرٌ (Physical injury; hurt; damage.) / ضَرَّ أَضَرَّ (To damage, hurt, or injure something, usually an inanimate object.)  [harm] / حِقْد (Intention to harm or deprive in an illegal or immoral way. Desire to take pleasu)  [malice] / [abusive language]",
 "どくいり": "مَسْمُوم (Killed, paralysed, or harmed by receiving a dose of poison.) / مَسْمُوم (Containing poison; poisonous.)  [poisoned]",
 "どくえき": "سُمّ (An animal toxin intended for defensive or offensive use; a biological poison del)  [venom]",
 "どくお": "خَاسِر (A person who loses; one who fails to win or thrive.) / فَاشِل (A person who is frequently unsuccessful in life.) / فَاشِل (A contemptible or unfashionable person.)  [loser]",
 "どくおんな": "عَانِس (unmarried woman)  [spinster]\npun on 独女, (abbr. of 独身女性)",
 "どくかがく": "عِلْم السُّمُوم (The branch of pharmacology that deals with the nature, effect, detection and tre)  [toxicology]",
 "どくがい": "سُمّ, سَمّ (A substance that is harmful or lethal to a living organism when ingested.) / سَمَّمَ, سَمَّ (To use poison to kill or paralyse (somebody).)  [poison]",
 "どくがにかかる": "وَقَعَ ضَحِيَّة, سَقَطَ ضَحِيَّة (To suffer as a result of external circumstances or someone else's actions.)  [to fall victim (to)]",
 "どくがろん": "وَحْدَة الْأَنَا (theory)  [solipsism]"
}
